#. Translators: description for the Connect gesture
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1483
msgid "Opens a dialog to start a remote session"
msgstr "Otvara dijaloški okvir za pokretanje udaljene sesije"

#. Translators: description for the Disconnect gesture
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1494
msgid "Disconnect a remote session"
msgstr "Odspoji udaljenu sesiju"

#. Translators: description for the gesture that connects or disconnects a remote session.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1505
msgid ""
"If a remote session is active, disconnects it; otherwise opens a dialog to "
"start a remote session"
msgstr ""
"Ako je udaljena sesija aktivna, prekida je; inače otvara dijaloški okvir za "
"pokretanje udaljene sesije"

#. Translators: gesture description for the ignoreNextGesture script
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1516
msgid ""
"Set the host to ignore the next gesture completely, sending next gesture to "
"the guest as is. Useful when you need to use the gesture asigned to toggle "
"between guest and host, in the guest machine."
msgstr ""
"Postavite domaćina da u potpunosti zanemari sljedeću gestu, šaljući sljedeću "
"gestu gostu kakva jest. Korisno kada trebate koristiti gestu označenu za "
"prebacivanje između gosta i domaćina, u kontroliranom računalu."

#. Translators: Report when the next gesture will be send to the guest ignoring everything else.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1524
msgid "Send next gesture to the guest"
msgstr "Pošalji sljedeću gestu kontroliranom računalu"

#. Translators: Documentation string for the script that toggles the control between guest and host machine.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1528
msgid "Toggles the control between guest and host machine"
msgstr "Preklapa kontrolu između gosta i host računala"

#. Translators: Presented when Insert+Alt+Tab is pressed without an active remote connection.
#. Connected to the relay, but no controlled computer is in the channel.
#. Taking control now would swallow every keystroke locally.
#. Translators: Presented when Insert+Alt+Tab is pressed without an active remote connection.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1539
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1545
msgid "No remote computer is connected."
msgstr "Udaljeno računalo nije povezano."

#. Translators: Presented when sending keyboard keys from the controlling computer to the controlled computer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1569
msgid "Controlling remote machine."
msgstr "Kontroliram udaljeno računalo."

#. Translators: gesture description for the toggle remote mute script
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1619
msgid "Mute or unmute the speech coming from the remote computer"
msgstr "Utišava ili odtišava zvuk udaljenog računala"

#. Translators: send Ctrl+Alt+Delete gesture description
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1628
msgid "Sends Ctrl+Alt+Delete to the remote machine"
msgstr "Šalje prečac Ctrl+Alt+Delete udaljenom računalu"

#. Translators: open addon settings gesture description
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1636
msgid "Opens the addon settings panel inside NVDA settings dialog"
msgstr "Otvara kategoriju postavki unutar dijaloškog okvira NVDA postavki"

#. Add-on summary, usually the user visible name of the addon.
#. Translators: Summary for this add-on to be shown on installation and add-on information.
#: buildVars.py:17
msgid "Tele NVDA remote assistance"
msgstr "Tele NVDA daljinska pomoć"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-ons manager
#: buildVars.py:20
msgid ""
"Allows remote control of and remote access to another machine. This add-on "
"is based on NVDA Remote."
msgstr ""
"Omogućuje daljinsko upravljanje i daljinski pristup drugom računalu. Ovaj je "
"dodatak temeljen na NVDA Remoteu."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:43
msgid ""
"Fix automatic updates that failed to complete with an \"access denied\" "
"error, recover installations stuck pending, add WebSocket relay connections "
"over HTTPS, including port 443, add Windows SSPI authentication for NTLM and "
"Kerberos HTTP proxies, improve proxy compatibility, and provide two remote "
"screenshot methods."
msgstr ""
"Popravite automatska ažuriranja koja se nisu uspjela dovršiti s pogreškom "
"\"pristup odbijen\", oporavite instalacije koje su zaglavile na čekanju, "
"dodajte relejne veze WebSocket preko HTTPS-a, uključujući priključak 443, "
"dodajte Windows SSPI autentifikaciju za NTLM i Kerberos HTTP proxyje, "
"poboljšajte kompatibilnost proxyja i pružite dvije udaljene metode snimanja "
"zaslona."

